3DBenchy.stl
  The single-part file from CreativeTools/3DBenchy. The repository
  says it may be downloaded, made and shared. It has no licence file.
  NTI, Daniel Norée and Paulo Kiefe put the model in the public domain
  in February 2025. That announcement is not a file in the repository.

xyzCalibration_cube.amf
xyzCalibration_cube.stl
  The 20 mm cube from PrusaSlicer commit 45d0532,
  resources/calibration/cube. The .amf is the zip that commit ships.
  The .stl was written here from that AMF (136 triangles, 20 mm) so
  GFOpenMake and GFOpenSlicer can open it. CC BY-SA 3.0,
  iDig3Dprinting. cube-LICENCE.txt is the note that came with the
  folder. The Thingiverse address in it is the attribution, not where
  this copy was taken from. The same note names a Voron v7 AMF. That
  AMF is not in this folder.

Voron_Design_Cube_v8.STL
  From Voron-Extras Test_Prints. GPL-3.0. GPL-3.0.txt is that
  repository's licence.

Mars-2020-sample-tube.stl
  NASA 3D Resources, the Mars 2020 sample tube. Free and without
  copyright. Not the insignia.
